msgctxt "80"
msgid "Dammit... We're still comin' for that money, just you wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Sorry, Aniki. I didn't mean to get you wrapped up in all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"So you've been borrowing money from a loan shark, Akiho? Don't you know what"
" happens when you get involved with thugs like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I just don't understand. It was only 300 grand to start... but before I knew"
" it, my debt had ballooned to four million."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Things have just gotten out of control. First they forced me to work at that"
" bikini bar, now they want me to film adult videos for them... Where does it"
" stop?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Akiho-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Rikiya. I should never have gotten you mixed up in my money "
"problems. Just... go, okay? I'll figure this out on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Hey, don't talk like that. I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I said I'd take care of you, right? What kinda guy would I be if I backed "
"down when you were hurtin' the most?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Rikiya, think about this for a second."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"I don't wanna hear it, Aniki. Me and those loan sharks are gonna have a "
"little chat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"See, my old man left me his fishing boat down in Okinawa. All I've gotta do "
"is sell that off and I'll have all the cash you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"And once your debt's paid off, we can finally go home. You'll be able to "
"start over, Akiho-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"And hey, that pendant'll look loads better on you when it's glistenin' in "
"the Okinawa sun. So, promise you'll come back with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "...I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "All right! Now first thing's first... Trackin' down those loan sharks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "You can't be serious about this, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Look, Aniki. I appreciate you trying to help or whatever, but this is my "
"problem now. So just... stay outta it, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Well, I should be getting back to the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"You're not going to wait for Rikiya? He's putting his life on the line for "
"you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Are you crazy? It's too dangerous for me to just stand around here. And "
"besides, didn't Rikiya tell you to stay out of this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Welp, bye!"
msgstr "Vabbè, ciao!"

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"(I better keep tabs on that girl. I have a feeling there's more to this than"
" meets the eye.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "(I'll probably find her over by the bikini bar...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Just pay up already. Didn't your mama ever teach you to give stuff back when"
" you borrow it, girlie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "But I thought I had until next week!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Technically, you do. But you n' me both know you're not gonna have it by "
"then. So, me and my boys thought we'd help you cover the difference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "How...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Oh, nothing too serious. Just three teensy little skin flicks oughta do the "
"trick. We'll keep it nice and anonymous, pinky promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Hey, assholes! Get the hell away from my friend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "And who the shit're you, curlycue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Akiho-san's bodyguard. I'm not gonna let you take advantage of her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"So what, you want us to just clear her debt? Forget it ever happened? Sorry,"
" pal. We're not leaving 'til we get our green back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "How much does she owe you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "A big old stack to the tune of 5 mil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "What!? But I only borrowed 4 million!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Pfft, ever heard of interest, honey? If you can't handle the rules, don't "
"play the game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"There's no point followin' the rules when the game is rigged! Now get lost "
"before I give you the ol' Rikiya special!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Big mistake, pal. Time to learn what happens when you don't mind your own "
"fuckin' business!"
msgstr ""

